  m_Name: Kaiju
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Description: 'Converts [HpToSizeConversion] of your Max HP into character Size.

    Converts
    your character''s Size into [BonusPower] {{MagicalPower}} and [SizeToDamageConversion]
    Bonus Heal percent.


    Every [Tick] seconds, deals [TickDamageHpPerc] of your
    Max Hp to enemies around you.


    On reaching a Size of [SizeThreshold], becomes
    [Uncontrollable] - making your character immuned to CC.'
